    summary: `Deuteronomy commands that a "stubborn and rebellious son", a glutton and drunkard who will not obey his parents, be brought to the elders and stoned. In Numbers a man found gathering sticks on the Sabbath is stoned outside the camp at the LORD's command.`,
    problem: `The death penalty for family rebellion and for gathering firewood seems wildly out of proportion, and fits poorly with Jesus' compassion.`,
